Typically the default of returnDef = FALSE is what one wants.  returnDef = TRUE requests that a model definition but not a model itself be returned.

The distInfo$discrete error is not immediately obvious.  Would you be willing to share reproducible code, which you might prefer to do off-list since it would include your data?  That would be the fastest way for one of us to look at what's happening.

-Perry

